WEBVTT

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.360
"I can't overcome it"  "I'm annoyed"

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.100
Even if I break down those hurdles

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.310
No answer emerges

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:34.810
Am I being controlled?  Everyone on the field

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.750
Isn't scared, go away, but...

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.450
The unseen road to the future

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:51.200
Cannot be chosen

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.500
Close your eyes and cut with your heart

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.160
just like cards, surely

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.230
It was promised  yes!  you are the winner

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.100
never lose!  Cut with your heart

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.330
just like cards, surely

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:16.680
Because a miracle will occur

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Heartless Duel
Yugi vs Jonouchi

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:57.300
He will arrive soon to meet his dear friends.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:03.000
Jonouchi and the girl are my pawns.

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:07.600
I'll enjoy the upcoming show.

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:10.440
Master Marik.

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:13.140
Rishido.

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:19.020
As you ordered, I gathered 12 Puzzle Cards in Battle City.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:19.900
Well done.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:27.480
Knowing you, you must've won by facing competitors head-on in Battle City.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.740
Using your trap strategies.

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:35.980
I don't need to brainwash you because you can't betray me.

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:40.170
Please take these Puzzle Cards.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:46.080
Now I can enter the Battle City Finals.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:49.180
As will you, Rishido.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:51.180
Yes, Master Marik.

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:53.800
Replenish Jonouchi's deck with cards.

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:54.500
Yes, sir.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:09.180
Jonouchi's deck is now a Burn Deck that uses great firepower to kill the player.

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:13.670
My family will now get its revenge.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:17.400
Your own dear friend will kill you, Yugi.

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:34.200
Jonouchi, please be safe.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.020
So naïve.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:45.340
If brainwashing is possible, Marik has already brainwashed Jonouchi to fight against you.

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:48.440
Because that's what I'd do.

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:53.710
Kaiba, I'm willing to risk my life to save Jonouchi!

00:03:53.950 --> 00:04:01.950
Yugi, I know you have no solution because of the contradictions in your heart.

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:03.600
Contradiction?

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:05.300
Yes, Yugi.

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:11.700
In our tag duel against the Rare Hunters, you preached the power of teamwork.

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:17.700
We can't defeat those Ghouls unless we work together!

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:24.100
But if you and Jonouchi have to fight and defeat each other...

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:28.780
Is there any room for teamwork?

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:33.280
Answer me, Yugi.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:41.790
There's someone on the pier!

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:45.730
It's Jonouchi!

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:54.310
Crush Yugi!  Crush him!

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:57.810
Kaiba, I'll find the answer here.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:04:59.740
Interesting.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.320
He's here.

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:07.960
Crush him!

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:16.040
Crush him!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.280
Jonouchi!

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:24.600
I've been waiting for you, Yugi.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.320
Jonouchi...

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:30.110
Marik has brainwashed him.

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:33.610
Jonouchi looks totally different!

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:36.110
Marik has brainwashed him.

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:39.120
Jonouchi, be yourself again!

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:40.660
Be myself?

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:43.110
I am myself.

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.620
And I want to beat you up.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:49.860
It's no good.  Marik is completely controlling him.

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:54.340
Yugi, you will have to duel me.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:58.740
One of us will die because we'll risk our lives in this duel!

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:00.240
Jonouchi!

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:06.090
Big brother, what's going on?

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:11.670
If you're a duelist, you must defeat your opponent, even if he's your friend.

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:14.100
It's a duelist's fate.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:17.170
Otherwise, you can't move forward.

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:19.520
A duelist's fate?

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:24.120
You can't talk about friendship and teamwork this time.

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:26.770
Yugi is facing questions in this duel.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:29.110
What will you do, Yugi?

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:31.270
Show me your answer.

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:38.000
Jonouchi, listen.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:43.060
From the bottom of my heart, I want to duel you in Battle City.

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:49.290
But only when we both become true duelists and can battle with our pride at stake!

00:06:51.330 --> 00:07:00.830
Yugi, when I keep winning and become a true duelist, I want you to duel me again.

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:03.830
Those words made me happy.

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:10.220
I believe that we both kept winning in order to fulfill that promise.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:14.370
But this duel is Marik's trap.

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:18.250
This isn't the duel that we promised each other!

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:23.750
Follow me, Yugi.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.770
The duel arena of death is this way.

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:28.490
Jonouchi!

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:31.950
It's pointless, Yugi.

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:36.510
No matter what you say, you can't avoid your duel against Jonouchi.

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:41.510
Anzu!

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.240
Jonouchi is my puppet.

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:48.310
My anger is controlling him.

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.250
Anzu is also brainwashed!

00:07:57.330 --> 00:08:02.490
Yugi, Jonouchi is waiting for you at the duel arena of death.

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:03.770
Anzu!

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:20.220
This is the duel arena.

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:26.080
Before you duel, wear these leg shackles.

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:35.090
Our shackles are chained to an anchor hanging above us!

00:08:35.090 --> 00:08:38.530
Yes.  This anchor weighs 300 kg.

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:45.510
When a player's life points reach 0, the bomb will explode 30 seconds later and drop the anchor.

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:48.100
Look at your feet.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:52.800
This box has the opponent's life counter.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:57.380
Inside the box is the key to your shackles.

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:01.970
Only the player who lowers his opponent's life points to 0 can get the key.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:07.360
He can unshackle himself before the anchor falls into the sea in 30 seconds.

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:13.100
The loser can't unshackle himself, so the anchor will drag him into the sea.

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:16.800
Yes.  Either you or me.

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:22.900
No!  I won't have such a dangerous duel against Jonouchi!

00:09:23.150 --> 00:09:25.700
It's too late to escape.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.550
The bomb on the anchor has started its countdown.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:41.700
If you do nothing, it'll explode in 40 minutes.

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:44.230
If that happens, you'll both fall into the sea.

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:48.200
This is easy.

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:53.170
If you want to save Jonouchi, all you need to do is lose.

00:09:54.430 --> 00:09:57.600
Marik, I'll never forgive you!

00:09:57.600 --> 00:10:00.650
A death match between Yugi and Jonouchi?

00:10:00.650 --> 00:10:03.210
What a cruel duel.

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:10.720
Marik is really trying to kill Yugi to get revenge from 3,000 years ago.

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:12.910
Make them stop, brother!

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:15.000
I don't approve this duel!

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:18.440
One of them will certainly die.

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:20.980
This is not a duel!

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:22.800
I don't approve!

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.700
Marik can't do whatever he likes in Battle City!

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:34.080
What?

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:40.580
Anzu!

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:42.950
What are you planning to do?

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:12.450
Look closely.

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:17.720
There's also a bomb on the chain holding this container.

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:18.450
What?

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:26.660
If you try anything funny, I'll press this button and drop the container on her.

00:11:27.730 --> 00:11:29.260
What a dirty trick!

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:35.830
Kaiba, just watch the incredible show that's about to begin.

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:40.760
Oh, I should let this girl enjoy the show as well.

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:45.520
Anzu!

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:50.520
Where am I?

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:53.750
What's going on?

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:54.910
Yugi...

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:56.620
Jonouchi!

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:59.860
This isn't fair, Marik!  Let Anzu go!

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:03.480
Yes, keep suffering.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:07.570
My family suffered much more than this.

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:09.880
Keep suffering, Pharaoh.

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:11.370
And die!

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:14.380
Oh, I almost forgot to tell you.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:18.400
Yugi, I don't care if you die in the sea.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:22.000
But I need you to leave your Slifer card behind.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:25.640
Take Slifer out of your deck.

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:30.620
My God Card is in here!

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:39.900
Red-Eyes B. Dragon...

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:46.840
Yugi, I can't take that Red-Eyes right now.

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:50.550
Red-Eyes won't approve of how I am.

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:56.050
So Yugi, take care of that card for now.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:04.320
I must duel with Red-Eyes in my deck.

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:10.830
I must use Red-Eyes B. Dragon so that Jonouchi will regain the heart of a duelist!

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:13.840
Put Slifer on the ground!

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:21.720
Whoever lives will get the God Card.

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:27.150
Everything is ready.

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:30.530
Jonouchi, kill Yugi!

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:36.260
Yugi...

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:37.760
Jonouchi...

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:42.300
Let's battle, Jonouchi!

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:44.460
Shuffle our decks!

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:46.000
Duel!

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:52.340
We're here, Shizuka.

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:53.000
Yes.

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:57.880
The smell of the city makes me nostalgic.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:02.580
My brother and I walked around here when we were little.

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:06.070
I want to meet my brother.

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:09.290
It's my turn to give him courage.

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:13.570
That's right.  So let's go see Jonouchi.

00:14:13.570 --> 00:14:14.350
Okay!

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:17.130
I wonder where everyone is...

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:19.640
Wait a moment.

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:26.580
Weird.  She's not picking up.

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:28.760
What's Anzu doing?

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:38.950
Yugi, you go first.

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:48.200
How should I duel when the one who loses his life points literally loses his life?

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:50.280
What's wrong, Yugi?

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:51.700
Bring out your monster!

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:55.200
Gazelle the King of Mythical Beasts!

00:14:57.070 --> 00:14:58.170
In defense position!

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:03.180
I end my turn.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:04.660
My turn.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.060
Here I go.  My card is...

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:09.420
Raigeki!

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:15.490
Next, I summon Alligator's Sword!

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:20.860
It attacks you directly!

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:26.660
What's wrong, Yugi?

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:28.550
You're nothing special.

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:32.650
But my terror is only getting started.

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:34.120
Bring it, Yugi!

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:36.110
My turn.  I draw.

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:39.350
Big Shield Gardna in defense position.

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:41.110
I end my turn.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:46.120
Even if you summon a monster to defend with, it's pointless!  My turn!

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:48.230
Take this!

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:50.770
Hinotama!

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:00.300
Yugi!

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:07.320
What?  Spell cards that strike the opponent directly are forbidden in this tournament!

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:14.320
Jonouchi's deck contains many forbidden cards that the Ghouls forged.

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:19.800
If your deck contains regular cards, you will never beat him.

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:22.570
You must be happy if your friend kills you.

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:24.730
Die, my hated Pharaoh!

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:30.730
Master Marik, one of Yugi's friends brought Jonouchi's sister to the city.

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:32.970
Jonouchi's sister?

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:38.760
She'll be a useful pawn to get revenge for my family.

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:40.710
Interesting.  Seize her!

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:53.820
How do you like the power of Hinotama, a forbidden card that kills the player?

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:57.590
Jonouchi...

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:01.730
Good.  Crush him.

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:04.730
Kill each other, Jonouchi.

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:08.100
You're my puppet to carry out my revenge!

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:10.570
I don't want to fight him.

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:13.640
This isn't the duel that we wanted.

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:20.710
But I must keep fighting if the heart of a duelist still burns inside him.

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:23.350
Your turn, Yugi.

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:29.090
I'll make sure that you regain the heart of a duelist!

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:33.030
I draw a card!

00:17:36.260 --> 00:17:38.080
I'm sorry, Shizuka.

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:42.040
I should've asked where he was before we left.

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:45.540
It's fine, Honda.  Don't worry about it.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:47.540
Shizuka...

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:51.360
I'm in the same city as my brother.

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:53.280
The same city!

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:56.280
That's why I'm sure we'll meet up.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.800
Who are you?

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:01.020
What do you want?

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:02.250
Honda?

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:06.200
You must be the Ghouls!

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:08.000
Damn!

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:13.060
I can beat them easily, but my priority is to protect Shizuka.

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:14.920
Shizuka, get on my back!

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:15.560
Okay!

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:16.800
Hold on tight!

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:17.670
After them!

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:20.800
Stop!  What are you doing, Jonouchi?

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:22.660
What's going on?

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:25.600
Jonouchi, you're a Ghoul now?

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:30.520
The Ghoul named Marik brainwashed Jonouchi.

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:32.250
Marik brainwashed him?

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:36.550
To get revenge for his family from 3,000 years ago.

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:39.260
I don't understand at all!

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:41.820
Revenge from 3,000 years ago...

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:47.600
So this battle is related to the other Yugi's lost memories?

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:50.770
Stop shouting, young lady.

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:53.770
Be quiet or I'll drop the container.

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:59.650
Go ahead!

00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:01.130
What?

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:02.650
Kaiba!  Mokuba!

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:06.150
I don't care what happens to me, so stop the duel!

00:19:07.970 --> 00:19:09.890
That's impossible.

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:20.260
Yugi, find a way to survive this silly duel that lacks the pride of a duelist.

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:22.700
C'mon, Yugi!

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:25.050
Stop stalling!

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:26.640
Bring out a monster!

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:34.880
Jonouchi has Alligator's Sword, which has 1500 attack points.

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:39.890
I have Big Shield Gardna, which has 2600 defense points.

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:45.240
I don't have a card in my hand that can destroy Alligator's Sword.

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:48.890
I must buy time by building up my defenses.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:52.630
I set a card!

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:59.820
And I summon Kuriboh in attack position and end my turn.

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:04.170
Kuriboh in attack position?

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:05.580
Are you mocking me?

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:12.920
If my Alligator's Sword attacks your Kuriboh, you'll lose a lot of life points!

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:20.260
I get it.  You've decided to die in order to save me.

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:23.490
Jonouchi, I won't die!

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.620
And I won't let you die either!

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:31.670
This duel won't end until one of us dies!

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:32.540
Here I go!

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:35.750
Alligator's Sword, attack Kuriboh!

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:40.180
I flip over my set card!

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:43.580
A trap card!

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:47.690
Spellbinding Circle protects Kuriboh!

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:53.830
Spellbinding Circle has sealed away Alligator's Sword!

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:55.530
That's pointless, Yugi!

00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:58.830
Cheap tricks won't work against his deck!

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:01.470
Please stop...

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:05.960
So what?  I don't care what happens to my monster.

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:09.210
I only care about eliminating your life points!

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:13.820
Take this again!

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:17.850
Hinotama!

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:52.020
To break Marik's mind control over Jonouchi, Yugi takes over for the other Yugi.

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:57.190
Believing in friendship, Yugi summons Red-Eyes, which seems to affect Jonouchi.

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:00.730
Red-Eyes, please bring Jonouchi back to his senses!

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:05.470
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Reach Him!
Red-Eyes B. Dragon of Friendship

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:07.020
Duel, standby!

00:22:24.130 --> 00:22:28.640
Even a long, long time ago

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:34.010
I feel like I've been here

00:22:34.530 --> 00:22:43.660
The setting sun colors the classroom after school

00:22:43.970 --> 00:22:55.170
We all laugh as you point out that I cut my bangs too short

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:02.700
Time passes bit by bit

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:07.970
The time when my bangs touch my eyelids

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:13.080
Will never change

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:18.350
The sunset envelops everyone

00:23:18.980 --> 00:23:23.560
To be who I am

00:23:24.150 --> 00:23:28.800
I've kept searching for something

00:23:29.450 --> 00:23:33.500
The time that we're now spending together

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:36.440
I learned that's the answer

00:23:37.230 --> 00:23:43.540
From now until forever...
